<title>ITALY: PRESS DIGEST - Italy - Dec 30.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Italy - Dec 30.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are some of the top headlines in leading Italian newspapers.</p>
<p>----------</p>
<p>TOP POLITICAL STORIES</p>
<p>Snow paralyses Italy, bad weather splits country in two (all).</p>
<p>Nazi skinheads vandalise Rome Jewish cemetery (all).</p>
<p>----------</p>
<p>TOP BUSINESS STORIES</p>
<p>Government to approve 4.3 trillion lire package of financial measures on Monday, last part of 1997 budget (all).</p>
<p>-----------</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +39266129450</p>
